cked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToiHSfKA", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 66, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8940096, "raw_content": "It\u2019s time for a return of the Tea Party movement. Donald Trump\u2019s political rise was fueled by the same grassroots frustration that gave birth to the Tea Party, and it\u2019s time to revive that spirit.\n\nWe cannot simply vote our way out of a system where the political establishment operates as one giant uniparty, protecting its own interests while ignoring the American people.\n\nOur Founding Fathers understood a principle we\u2019ve forgotten: NO TAXATION WITHOUT REPRESENTATION.\n\nIf our elected officials refuse to represent us, then it\u2019s time to exercise our economic power. Peaceful economic boycotts of businesses and government institutions that undermine American interests can send a message that politicians refuse to hear.\n\nWhy should hardworking Americans continue to shoulder an ever growing tax burden while being treated like second-class citizens in their own country?\n\nThe Tea Party wasn\u2019t just about taxes. It was about accountability, representation, and reminding the government who it works for.\n\nIt\u2019s time to bring that spirit back.\n\nImagine opening a restaurant, paying thousands in taxes, permits, insurance, rent, and regulatory compliance, only to watch local government potentially allow illegal competitor to operate without meeting those same requirements. Same with welfare\n\nIf the rules apply to one, they should apply to everyone. Period.\n\nAmericans are expected to finance the government and obey its laws, but what happens when that same government selectively enforces those laws?\n\nNo taxation without representation. No special treatment. Equal enforcement of the law.\n\n", "author": "DonHustler2024", "created": 1794687129578, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "okboomer59", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "NO TAXATION WITHOUT REPRESENTATION.", "last_comment_created": 1794699732491, "content": "<p>It\u2019s time for a return of the Tea Party movement. Donald Trump\u2019s political rise was fueled by the same grassroots frustration that gave birth to the Tea Party, and it\u2019s time to revive that spirit.</p>\n<p>We cannot simply vote our way out of a system where the political establishment operates as one giant uniparty, protecting its own interests while ignoring the American people.</p>\n<p>Our Founding Fathers understood a principle we\u2019ve forgotten: NO TAXATION WITHOUT REPRESENTATION.</p>\n<p>If our elected officials refuse to represent us, then it\u2019s time to exercise our economic power. Peaceful economic boycotts of businesses and government institutions that undermine American interests can send a message that politicians refuse to hear.</p>\n<p>Why should hardworking Americans continue to shoulder an ever growing tax burden while being treated like second-class citizens in their own country?</p>\n<p>The Tea Party wasn\u2019t just about taxes. It was about accountability, representation, and reminding the government who it works for.</p>\n<p>It\u2019s time to bring that spirit back.</p>\n<p>Imagine opening a restaurant, paying thousands in taxes, permits, insurance, rent, and regulatory compliance, only to watch local government potentially allow illegal competitor to operate without meeting those same requirements. Same with welfare</p>\n<p>If the rules apply to one, they should apply to everyone. Period.</p>\n<p>Americans are expected to finance the government and obey its laws, but what happens when that same government selectively enforces those laws?</p>\n<p>No taxation without representation. No special treatment. Equal enforcement of the law.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 9, "score_up": 66, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToiHTlBZ", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 23, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8940441, "raw_content": "", "author": "CleanUpPhillyTrump24", "created": 1794707737111, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "KermitFrog", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "slaynews.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://slaynews.com/illegal-alien-trucker-arrested-killing-young-mom-2-sons-horror-crash-driving-watching-youtube/", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Illegal Alien Trucker Arrested for Killing Young Mom & 2 Sons in Horror Crash While Driving and Watching YouTube", "last_comment_created": 1794709523018, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 2, "score_up": 23, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"description": "An illegal alien truck driver who was released into the United States under the Biden administration has been charged after allegedly plowing into stopped traffic in Missouri because he was distracted while watching YouTube.", "title": "Illegal Alien Trucker Arrested for Killing Young Mom 